Equation of chord of hyperbola $x^2-y^2=a^2$ with mid-point as $(h, k)$ is given by
$\begin{array}{rlrl} 
& x h-y k & =h^2-k^2 \\
\Rightarrow \quad y & =\frac{h}{k} x-\frac{\left(h^2-k^2\right)}{k}
\end{array} \\ This will touch the parabola $y^2=4 a x$, if
$$\begin{aligned}
-$$\left(\frac{h^2-k^2}{k}\right)$& =$\frac{a}{\frac{h}{k}}$\\
\Rightarrow \quad a k² & =h³+k² h
\end{aligned}\therefore$ Locus of the mid-point is $x^3=y²(x-a)
